A concurrent zone change application proposes to rezone the property from MUB and A-1 (County) to CB
(City). An annexation is in process as well and will need to be complete before platting and zoning take
effect.
PLAT ANALYSIS:
Review of a preliminary plat is organized by analysis of the review criteria described in Preliminary Plat
Review Criteria outlined in Article 2, Section 2.1.2d. The purpose of these review criteria is to provide a
consistent review and discussion for preliminary plat applications.
1 || Policies | Physical Patterns | Comprehensive Plan - The application is in accordance with the
development policies and physical patterns identified in the Comprehensive Plan.
Generally the proposal appears to be consistent with PlanCheyenne. The property is within the Urban
Service Boundary. The Future Land Use Plan map in PlanCheyenne indicates Community Business for
